: "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/0feab7f6-e324-4c39-9d5d-60fafc33b765.jpeg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "投资"], "excerpt": "\n三季度以来，A股市场经历了一轮显著的震荡与结构再平衡，四季度的市场投资主线正成为各方关注的焦点。\n\n近日，万家基金、摩根资产管理、汇丰晋信基金、博时基金、国联安基金等多家基金公司发布最新的四季度投资策略。公募机构普遍认为，三季度的市场调整主要源于交易拥挤度消化与资金再平衡，并非核心产业逻辑的反转。面对即将到来的四季度", "published_at": "2026-10-06T00:45:48Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-06T10:12:29Z", "body": "bodies/feed-413bee2e71be.json", "engagement": 170, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-46a49abc6cec", "title": "华为徐直军：昇腾中国市场份额已超英伟达，中国芯片自主化是必然之路", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783066", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/d0/24/94/-1-2-.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "科技"], "excerpt": "日前，在上海举行的华为全联接（HC）大会期间，华为发布了面向AI时代的Peerium计算架构，以及作为其关键互联技术的UnifiedBus灵衢总线。\n\n这是华为在计算架构上的一次重要突破。过去，大规模AI集群主要依靠网络将大量服务器和处理器连接起来，规模越大，数据传输、通信等待带来的效率损失也越明显。Peerium试图", "published_at": "2026-10-06T08:55:18Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-06T10:12:29Z", "body": "bodies/feed-46a49abc6cec.json", "engagement": 150, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-5198cd921217", "title": "GTA 6 writer says the series has never had \"much focus on national politics\" beyond GTA 4's war on terror, and the latest entry won't get \"too specific\"", "source": "Rock Paper Shotgun", "author": "Mark Warren", "url": "https://www.rockpapershotgun.com/gta-6-writer-says-the-series-has-never-had-much-focus-on-national-politics-beyond-gta-4s-war-on-terror-and-the-latest-entry-wont-get-too-specific", "image_url": "https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/gta-6-writer-on-politics-american-dream-satire-01.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Entertainment", "topic": "gaming", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Entertainment", "Rock Paper Shotgun", "en", "gaming", "text", "游戏"], "excerpt": "Details about and dev chatter concerning GTA 6 continue to drip out as part of the marketing push towards its console launch in November. This time, some of", "published_at": "2026-10-05T13:23:13Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-06T10:12:29Z", "body": "bodies/feed-5198cd921217.json", "engagement": 110, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-530a793fcb5a", "title": "Viral AI-Generated Comedian Steals Jokes And Is Rewarded With Millions Of Views", "source": "Kotaku", "author": "Zack Zwiezen", "url": "https://kotaku.com/viral-ai-generated-comedian-steals-jokes-and-is-rewarded-with-millions-of-views-2000740077", "image_url": "https://kotaku.com/app/uploads/2026/10/Ai-comedian-steal-jkokes-1280x720.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Entertainment", "topic": "gaming", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Entertainment", "Kotaku", "en", "gaming", "text", "科技"], "excerpt": "Shorts created with generative AI tools have been flooding social media and vertical video platforms for a bit now. But a new example shows just how shitty", "published_at": "2026-10-05T22:33:59Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-06T10:12:29Z", "body": "bodies/feed-530a793fcb5a.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-5995ae2b7bd5", "title": "Robert and Michelle King want humanity to be the focus of Cupertino's AI stories", "source": "AV Club", "author": "Saloni Gajjar", "url": "https://www.avclub.com/robert-michelle-king-cbs-cupertino-interview-anti-ai", "image_url": "https://img.pastemagazine.com/wp-content/avuploads/2026/10/02164945/mike-colter.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Entertainment", "topic": "film", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["AV Club", "Entertainment", "en", "film", "text", "科技"], "excerpt": "At one point in CBS’s Cupertino, Christy Palladino (Ella Stiller) exasperatedly asks, “Is anybody not paranoid?” Christy, an assistant at an upstart law firm", "published_at": "2026-10-05T10:00:17Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-06T10:12:29Z", "body": "bodies/feed-5995ae2b7bd5.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-7feb8df85e52", "title": "欧洲财政压力正成为美债抛售的新导火索", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783047", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/dde4a576-946f-435a-af25-fb363a82abc1.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "旅行探店"], "excerpt": "法国债务危机与西班牙政治动荡叠加美国自身结构性赤字问题，正推动全球债券市场进入新一轮动荡周期。\n\n\n美国10年期国债收益率周一盘中一度攀升至5.349%，创24年来新高，30年期收益率亦触及5.703%。与此同时，法国10年期国债收益率升至2002年以来最高水平，与德国国债的利差扩大至欧债危机以来最宽。欧元兑美元今年已", "published_at": "2026-10-06T02:06:06Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-06T10:12:29Z", "body": "bodies/feed-7feb8df85e52.json", "engagement": 190, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-8581416f9308", "title": "35 English Loanwords That Come From the Japanese Language", "source": "Coto Academy", "author": "Coto Academy Staff Writer", "url": "https://cotoacademy.com/english-loanwords-that-come-from-japanese-language/", "image_url": "https://cotoacademy.com/app/uploads/2022/12/5.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Learning", "topic": "japanese", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Coto Academy", "Learning", "en", "japanese", "text", "日语学习"], "excerpt": "\nWhile Japanese has tons of English loanwords, English actually borrows quite a bit from Japanese as well. Words like sushi, karate, or tsu